OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLate
OL,6,Fsunshine for many then a dry evening
OL,7,Fand overnight period with lengthy
OL,8,Fclear periods. Perhaps cloudier in
OL,9,FCumbria later with the odd spot of
OL,10,Fdrizzle. A cooler night and turning
OL,11,Frather chilly in the countryside.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FTurning gradually cloudier
OL,14,Fthrough the day with some light rain
OL,15,For drizzle possible across Cumbria.
OL,16,FStaying generally dry elsewhere with
OL,17,Fthe best of the sunshine in southern
OL,18,Fregions. Feeling warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
