OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FProbably mostly cloudy on Tuesday with
OL,7,Fscattered light showers. Turning
OL,8,Fbreezier and cooler on Wednesday with
OL,9,Fsome rain, perhaps heavy for a time.
OL,10,FDry with sunny spells on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
